# Log Analyzer

Monitors system log files in real time, filtering and displaying only error entries.

## How it works
- Scans `/var/log` (Linux) or `C:\Windows\Logs` (Windows)
- Filters lines containing error keywords
- Updates every 5 seconds
- Displays timestamp, file path, and error message

## Usage
```bash
./program
```

## Built with
- Nim
